Package: shinyTAG
Type: Package
Title: Interactive Shiny Viewer for gutenTAG MALDI-MSI Data
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("John", "Abbey", email = "john.abbey@uzh.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: shinyTAG provides an interactive Shiny web application for
    visualising the output of the gutenTAG package. Users can load MALDI-MSI
    data, inspect metapeak segmentation on an interactive spectrum panel,
    select single-channel ion images by clicking on metapeak regions, and
    examine quality control statistics through a tabbed QC dashboard.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.4)
Imports:
    shiny (>= 1.8.0),
    bslib (>= 0.7.0),
    plotly (>= 4.10.0),
    htmlwidgets,
    ggplot2,
    gutenTAG
Suggests:
    BiocStyle,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
